Telegen includes and integrates with third-party open-source software.

This product depends on:

1) OpenTelemetry eBPF Instrumentation (OBI)
   - Module: go.opentelemetry.io/obi
   - Version: v0.10.0
   - Copyright: The OpenTelemetry Authors
   - License: Apache License 2.0
   - Source: https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-ebpf-instrumentation
   - Integration model: Telegen keeps a synchronized forked runtime
     implementation under internal/ for eBPF tracer and bytecode packages
     that upstream ships under pkg/internal/. Go's internal visibility rules
     prevent importing those module-private runtime packages directly from
     go.opentelemetry.io/obi in external modules, so Telegen re-syncs
     behavior to upstream releases while preserving feature parity.

See LICENSE files of dependencies for full license text where applicable.
